                    <div class="key-takeaways">
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>Dataflow provides producer-consumer building blocks.</span></div>
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>Link blocks together to form pipelines.</span></div>
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>BoundedCapacity prevents memory issues.</span></div>
                        <div class="takeaway"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span>PropagateCompletion chains completion signals.</span></div>
